+// The backend-neutral caller (sim_g2_gpu.cpp) fills G2GpuData from the
+// DS registers; this function turns it into GL draws into the caller's
+// layer textures (units 10-14 are the data textures, as in the original
+// sim_g2_gpu.cpp). Returns false only when its resources failed to build.
